    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The natural order just got reshuffled. Feast on trash, absorb microplastics, and reach deep into the gene pool with volatile enhancements and endless upgrades. Mix and match eight unique squirrel types to create the ultimate swarm. It's time to rewrite evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras/89cb8d50cad047cfac6fb35fa191076e.poster.avif?t=1754945621\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras/89cb8d50cad047cfac6fb35fa191076e.webm?t=1754945621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras/89cb8d50cad047cfac6fb35fa191076e.mp4?t=1754945621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploding squirrels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diseased squirrels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind-control squirrels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired RNG mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine-tuned swarm behavior</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The natural order just got reshuffled. Feast on trash, absorb microplastics, and reach deep into the gene pool with volatile enhancements and endless upgrades. Mix and match eight unique squirrel types to create the ultimate swarm. It's time to rewrite evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras/89cb8d50cad047cfac6fb35fa191076e.poster.avif?t=1754945621\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras/89cb8d50cad047cfac6fb35fa191076e.webm?t=1754945621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras/89cb8d50cad047cfac6fb35fa191076e.mp4?t=1754945621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploding squirrels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diseased squirrels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind-control squirrels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired RNG mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine-tuned swarm behavior</p></li></ul>",
